  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从咖啡师到瑜伽老师的转变 - 末末 x 米拉 x 柚桑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685bf2cc50e8c269ca82d73c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685bf2cc50e8c269ca82d73c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Jun 2025 13:12:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「本期嘉宾」 末末</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐅 如果你也去过上海西康路的虎伢咖啡，一定也曾受到过末末温暖的照顾，现在成为瑜伽老师的她，又会给我们带来怎样的成长分享呢？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTmc_jMYV7h2GQZOP63tFQ-7uzH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「本期你会听到」</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a> ——从咖啡师到瑜伽老师的转变与幸福生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">00:06:17</a> 身心合一时，内在练习是关键——传统与现代瑜伽教学的传承与演变</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">00:12:35</a> 瑜伽中的身心链接：通过感受身体来达到身心合一的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">00:18:52</a> 冥想与瑜伽：探索心灵流动的状态与呼吸的奥秘</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">00:25:10</a> 感知自我：瑜伽的力量与心灵的和谐</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">00:31:28</a> 寻找心灵的归属：从虚无到实在的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">00:37:47</a> 困惑与意义：寻找内心的指引与学习的动力</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2644">00:44:04</a> 瑜伽馆 vs. 在家瑜伽：体验感和效果的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3025">00:50:25</a> 悦性、惰性和激性的平衡：探索瑜伽的三种属性</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">00:56:38</a> 找到你的内在之旅：瑜伽与你的呼吸、情绪和内在力量</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3779">01:02:59</a> 唤醒内在空间：探索自我并善用身体的指导方针</span></p><span></span><p><span>•<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4157">01:09:17</a> 深入传统，寻找最终目标：心灵归宿的追求之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span>「找到末末老师」</span></p><span></span><p><span>wechat：momo_box</span></p><span></span><p><span>新人小白一对一私教 🧘‍</span></p><span></span><p><span>「提及参考」</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/66GYGqFy4joa5C5_ZA_Krw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/66GYGqFy4joa5C5_ZA_Krw"><span>杲·Gao Yoga | 一颗心念的种子</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YZ51E-hIgibHyTeUzSCIDQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YZ51E-hIgibHyTeUzSCIDQ"><span>Gokul Yoga戈库瑜伽</span></a></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0eHUwROwKxDzsO8lXTqiaHWDj7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo7EgisUmlHESrtlO1wqITe4KZ8N.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYaTbXuQt_zUb_wHCiSSybqnGcL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo6FGPdqRyBcOECrTguCmpq8Sovo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「关于我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档关于精品咖啡如何改变我们生活的闲聊节目，偶尔有干货，大部分时间是闲聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「主持人」</span></p><span></span><p><span>米拉 x 柚桑</span></p>]]></description>
